          "docs": "Publish one or more Equipment Events This endpoint allows clients to submit new `EquipmentEvent`s to Kuehne+Nagel's system. These events provide updates on equipment status as defined by the DCSA standard. **Note: In the current version, only one event at a time is accepted.**\n"
